'' A SCAN OF CODE MID-EDIT still returns what the front end got through: the declarations
'' before the damage and the ones after it. 'After' comes back inside 'Broken' because the
'' unclosed IF takes Broken's 'end sub' -- the parser's recovery, reported as it is.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan tests/api/src/scanbroken.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: type Before  @0:3:6  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: sub Broken  @0:7:5  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: function After as long  @0:12:10
'' EXPECT-OUT: param z as long  @0:12:23
'' EXPECT-OUT: diags: 3
